      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The market trend is shifting rapidly, and staying silent may no longer be viable. A proactive stance on the Act, or at least a clear position on the issue, can help demonstrate a commitment to corporate responsibility and social accountability, which can enhance reputation and build trust with environmentally-conscious customers. This stance can also help to gauge your company's relevance and resilience in the face of changing consumer expectations.",
